      <details class="data reveal">
        <summary>Questionnaire Experience, Participation & Sustainability</summary>
        <div class="data-body">
          <div class="finding-grid">
            <article class="finding"><strong>87%</strong><h4>Natural Environment</h4><p>Respondents strongly appreciate the park’s environmental quality.</p></article>
            <article class="finding"><strong>47.8%</strong><h4>Limited Interactive Products</h4><p>This was identified as a key weakness.</p></article>
            <article class="finding"><strong>47.8%</strong><h4>Recreational Products</h4><p>These were the most frequently used facilities.</p></article>
            <article class="finding"><strong>65.2%</strong><h4>Interested in Giving Ideas</h4><p>Users support participation when the process is accessible.</p></article>
